  "body": "The spec should probably define the set of Bluetooth host operations used in each step, while right now it just says things like \"support a service\" and \"enable notifications\". For security and privacy related operations, we'll need to say something about the allowed packet sequences.\n\nThis is extra tricky because it needs to be implementable on top of several platform APIs that say little about what operations they cause.\n",
